    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clement Herron Real Estate are delighted to offer this three bedroom, three bathroom end of terrace house to the market.\r\n\r\nAccommodation briefly includes entrance hall, sitting room, guest w.c., large kitchen / dining room , utility room, three bedrooms, one ensuite and main family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe River Village estate is located in the Monksland area of Athlone. Several shops (including a SuperValu), a 4-star hotel with fitness studio and pool as well as a medical centre within walking distance. Local bus service connecting the estate with the town centre."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 1.04 x 4.3\r\nWith wooden floor\r\n\r\nSitting room: 4.275 x 3.691\r\nWith wooden floor\r\n\r\nGuest WC: 1.38 x 1.52  \r\nTiled with w.c. and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining room: 5.42 x 2.53\r\nWith tiled floor and splashback, Shaker style fitted kitchen\r\nPatio door leading onto garden area \r\n\r\nUtility Room 2.06 x 0.85\r\n\r\nLanding and stairs with carpet.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 2.99 x 3.7\r\nWith carpet\r\nEnsuite: 3.7sq.mtrs.\r\nTiled with w.c., w.h.b. and separate shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.72 x 2.739\r\nWith carpet and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 2.6 x 2.739\r\nWith carpet and fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.88 x 2.62\r\nTiled with w.c., w.h.b., bath and separate shower unit\r\n\r\nTo the rear, there is a secure enclosed garden accessed to the side, featuring a patio area and lawn"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Gas fired central heating.\r\nGarden to front and rear, South West facing rear gardens.\r\nQuiet residential location.\r\nEnclosed back garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C1"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "By Appointment Only."
      }
    ],
